    "title": "Detectives ask for public's help in locating missing man - NewsBreak",
    "text": "LINCOLNTON, N.C. ( QUEEN CITY NEWS ) — The Lincoln County Sheriff’s Office is asking for the public’s help in locating a missing person. Jamie Islas-Ramirez, 39, of Vale, was last heard from by his family on June 20, 2025. Authorities say Jamie is known to frequent Gaston and Lincoln County and has connections to Florida. If you or anyone you know has seen this man, contact the Lincoln County Sheriff’s Office at 704-732-9050, the Lincoln County Communications Center at 704-735-8202 or Lincolnton/Lincoln County Crime Stoppers at 704-736-8909. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Queen City News.",
